	(text "In our design, we use a 2-pin electrical connector (suitable for 0.34-0.54 mm² / 22-20 AWG wire) \nto disconnect and reconnect the main power line leading to the second-tier module. \nThis allows the battery to be removed for charging, \nas the model does not include an onboard charging circuit-omitting it saves space."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 65.786 72.136 0)
		(effects
